        <detaileddescription>
<para>walkupDots</para><para>There&apos;s a bug in Qing&apos;s R/W sets in that it handles dot and arrow expressions weirdly. If you have a reference like a.b.c.d R/W sets returns just a.b. This makes it hard to get all the info we need. So This recursive function walks up the dot expressions to get the outtermost dot expression so we can interpret the whole reference. </para>        </detaileddescription>
